# Who am I? Fairy tale guessing game with both bonus options

2. [Streamlit-URL] / [GitHub-URL]

3. Rules are simple: just try to guess which character the LLM got with yes or no questions. Every 3 questions you are forced to guess, but if you are sure you know it you can click the guess button. After that you can look at your stats and the best and worst question.

4. The app.py is only for the navigation between the pages. The play.py has the whole game with the start screen, the board with all the characters, the chat with the witch and the buttons. The stats.py shows all the stats after a round. In the Images folder are the pictures of all characters and the heart.

5. The LLM was used as the second player. You are forced to guess the LLM's character. The LLM answers based on the pictures and common knowledge about fairy tales. It also evaluates the number of characters you rule out per question.

6. Extra 2: as explained before, the calculations from the LLM are used here for a second page, Stats, where you can see how long you took, how many lives you had left, how many questions you asked and what your best and worst question were.

7. We implemented a start.bat just so you can pull the git, press start and play instead of using a terminal. The API key will be input on the site itself, so no worry about it being leaked.

8. Except the hearts, all pictures were created using Gemini, as we thought that was easier because of copyright, and we hope it is an acceptable use of AI. The heart was created by WildGoblinDev.